WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.201
- You guys are (beep)
with me, though, right?

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.870
Like, I don't actually
need all this stuff,

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.206
this is overkill.

00:00:04.206 --> 00:00:07.666
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.710
- Today we're learning from Michelle Phan.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.670
- I've never put on makeup for myself.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.380
- I have two sisters who
tortured me with makeup.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.258
- I am doing Michelle
Phan's Midnight Luster.

00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:18.385
- I am doing 'How to
look like a K-Pop Star'.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.011
- I'm putting on makeup
for a romantic date.

00:00:20.011 --> 00:00:24.558
- I chose the wedding tutorial
because, on my wedding day,

00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:28.603
my wife spent like hours
doing her hair and makeup.

00:00:28.603 --> 00:00:30.856
- This already looks extremely difficult.

00:00:30.856 --> 00:00:33.775
- Lightweight brunette brown gel?

00:00:33.775 --> 00:00:35.194
- There are so many brushes.

00:00:35.194 --> 00:00:37.279
- [Voiceover] Do women
actually own this much makeup?

00:00:37.279 --> 00:00:38.739
'Cause that's crazy.

00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:40.907
- [Voiceover] Is concealer
like a one size fits all?

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:43.619
- She's making her wider Vietnamese eyes

00:00:43.619 --> 00:00:46.788
look pointier like my Korean eyes.

00:00:46.788 --> 00:00:48.665
- Like combing my eyebrows,
never done that before.

00:00:48.665 --> 00:00:50.793
- Yeah, yeah, this is too, too bright.

00:00:50.793 --> 00:00:52.252
- Getting ready for a football game.

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.921
That's how I'm gonna make
this gender-normative.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:57.967
- This is basically exactly
what Michelle Phan was doing.

00:00:57.967 --> 00:00:59.676
- Do women spend this
long on just the eyes

00:00:59.676 --> 00:01:01.178
or am I just dumb?

00:01:01.178 --> 00:01:02.305
- You know what I'm so upset about,

00:01:02.305 --> 00:01:03.848
is that Eugene is going
to be so good at this

00:01:03.848 --> 00:01:04.973
because he had sisters.

00:01:04.973 --> 00:01:06.767
- As long as I'm prettier
than Zach, I'll be okay.

00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:08.143
- It's very possible that I've been using

00:01:08.143 --> 00:01:09.353
the wrong one the whole time.

00:01:09.353 --> 00:01:11.780
- You apply the foundation normally.

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:14.149
That's not a descriptor.

00:01:14.149 --> 00:01:16.068
- Next time a friend asks me
to come with her to Sephora

00:01:16.068 --> 00:01:18.195
and I'm like really
impatient and getting angry

00:01:18.195 --> 00:01:19.279
about how long it looks, I'm going to just

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:20.363
shut the (beep) up

00:01:20.363 --> 00:01:21.448
like I get it now, I get it.

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:23.658
- Ahhh, I touched my eyeball with it!

00:01:23.658 --> 00:01:24.910
- Oh, I just stabbed my eyeball.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:25.704
- Poked myself in the eye.

00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:28.551
- I don't know why my solution
is to just make it bigger,

00:01:28.551 --> 00:01:29.289
but it is.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:31.875
- Oh yeah! Instantly sexier.

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:33.795
- Beauty is pain, beauty
is pain, beauty is pain...

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:36.338
- Whoa! I broke it.

00:01:36.338 --> 00:01:37.756
- Eye torture complete.

00:01:37.756 --> 00:01:38.840
Nope, I (beep) it up.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.175
- I've seen videos online where girls

00:01:40.175 --> 00:01:41.843
chop off their eyelashes doing this.

00:01:41.843 --> 00:01:45.193
- (yelling) Wasn't so bad.

00:01:45.193 --> 00:01:46.223
(coughs)

00:01:46.223 --> 00:01:47.933
- This isn't right, but it's something.

00:01:47.933 --> 00:01:49.834
- Look at me now, Mom.

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:51.729
Everything you wanted.

00:01:51.729 --> 00:01:53.170
- Here's your beauty shot.

00:01:54.397 --> 00:01:56.149
- Do I like beautiful? Yes!

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.737
Did my wife look better
on her wedding day?

00:01:58.737 --> 00:01:59.862
Absolutely.

00:01:59.862 --> 00:02:01.781
- I just look like a pretty
guy, who could maybe make it

00:02:01.781 --> 00:02:05.530
in a K-pop band, that's okay
with lipstick and eye glitter.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:08.245
- I knew it was like,
something that took an hour,

00:02:08.245 --> 00:02:09.663
I didn't think it was something

00:02:09.663 --> 00:02:11.166
that made you stressed for an hour.

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:13.489
- I just look like a
confused glittery panda.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:16.419
- I feel like I could
practice this for years,

00:02:16.419 --> 00:02:17.671
and still be terrible at it.

00:02:17.671 --> 00:02:21.269
(magical tinkling)

00:02:22.549 --> 00:02:25.270
- Thanks, Michelle!

00:02:27.764 --> 00:02:29.683
- Your hair's blocking, Eugene.

00:02:29.683 --> 00:02:31.524
Your hair? Your h-- Eugene, your hair?

00:02:31.524 --> 00:02:33.077
Your hair's in the-- Just don't wanna...

00:02:36.584 --> 00:02:38.400
The hair again.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.526
It's really, it's just that,
I don't think you realize

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:42.012
how small my head is, and
how large your hair is?

